{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bf7d56aaf4597006","name":"The Joruba Consortium","source":{"id":"source:reference-bf7d56aaf4597006","title":"The Joruba Consortium","revision":21201,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:20:44Z","sha256":"ebbda34d9d629f10ee08bc4a0bec4b5ab5c97889633462d216f3df759fc69f02","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21201","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Joruba%20Consortium&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bf7d56aaf4597006","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although The Joruba Consortium is relatively unknown to the general populace, it is well respected in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mid Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mid_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," business community as a capable wholesale distributor for a bewildering array of goods- ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeders","referenceId":"reference:8831ac17fd67f6fc"},", foodstuffs, holovid projectors, and much more. The Consortium does not produce these goods, but buys them in enormous quantities and ships them throughout the galaxy using its diverse fleet of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". Beneath this veneer of respectability, however, lies a dark truth. The Joruba Consortium uses its shipping fleet, wealth, and bureaucratic favors to smuggle almost every type of illegal item known, including slaves, to the lawless planets of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Joruba Consortium Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"